{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12110260","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1211026001:1":{"text":"마스터... 골렘이에요! 무인도에 골렘이 나타났어요!","source_cn":"主人……有魔偶！魔偶出现在无人岛了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2E66380EF84CC55A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터... 골렘이에요! 무인도에 골렘이 나타났어요!","female":"마스터... 골렘이에요! 무인도에 골렘이 나타났어요!","variant_male_record_index":"129442","variant_female_record_index":"129443","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211026002:1":{"text":"우와! 큰 장난감이다!","source_cn":"是大玩具！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x062B8793537E50B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211026003:1":{"text":"저건 위험한 전쟁 도구예요. 거리를 두는 게 좋아요.","source_cn":"这是很危险的战争机器，最好保持距离。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91CF26EC6215533D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211026004:1":{"text":"그러고 보니 유적의 산보다 골렘이 더 많은 것 같아요.","source_cn":"不过话说回来，这里的魔偶简直比遗迹群山还要多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA438AE931EF9C7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211026005:1":{"text":"파도와 표류의 신은 우리가 이 골렘을 처리해 주길 바란 걸까요?","source_cn":"风浪与漂泊之神是希望我们打败这些魔偶吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB339CF4BC613003C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211026006:1":{"text":"열쇠의 이름을 잘 생각해 봐. 잠적의 열쇠잖아.","source_cn":"你们仔细想想那把钥匙的名字，是潜藏之钥。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x134E943F7C56181C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211026007:1":{"text":"전설에 따르면 파도와 표류의 신은 은신의 달인이라 행방을 쫓기 어렵다고 했어.","source_cn":"传说中，风浪与漂泊之神很善于躲藏，祂的行踪捉摸不定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD06C9B1CF8F2AE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211026008:1":{"text":"그렇다면 신의 성격으로 봤을 때, 이번 시련은 수비병과 싸우는 게 아니라 피해야 하는 것 아닐까요?","source_cn":"这样的话，根据那位神明的性格来看，这次试炼是让我们躲开...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DED1AA467CC22A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211026009:1":{"text":"나도 그렇게 생각해.","source_cn":"我认同你的看法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD9DA9CAA087458","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211026010:1":{"text":"자세히 보니까 이 녀석들의 시야에 사각지대가 있는 것 같아. 신중하게 움직이면 들키지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"刚才我仔细观察了一下，这些家伙都有视野盲区，我们谨慎些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2F87D0A6F547E80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"나라","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":5}}